  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "Cuttable power link (net tie) between two 1.5 mm2 (16 AWG) solder holes, 6 mm apart. The 2.5 mm wide F.Cu bridge (under solder mask) carries the full input current. To reroute, cut the bridge between the silk marks and solder wires into the holes.")
